<p>H.E. Mariam bint Mohammed Almheiri, Vice Chair and Managing Director of 2PointZero Group, represented IHC at the Adani Group Annual Conference in Mumbai, sharing her perspective on one of the world's most dynamic and consequential economic partnerships.</p>
<p>Speaking on the panel, The India Bet: How Long-Term Capital Will Shape the USD 10 Trillion Blueprint, H.E. highlighted the role of patient capital, strategic investment, and trusted partnerships in supporting India's next phase of growth.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz c1oinno0 swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ihc-uae_ihc-uaepledge-activity-7468274195290918914-blOe?utm_source=share&amp;utm_m