<p>Under His Highness's leadership, the UAE has become a global benchmark for stability, resilience, and ambition.</p>
<p>We join the Pledge and Commitment initiative in gratitude for the security and prosperity we share, and in recognition of a leader who embodies the honour of this country.</p>
<p>Together, we remain committed to the UAE&rsquo;s unity, stability, progress, and prosperity.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/b6f2dbcf-20ad-4f59-a867-ba09a02d0642 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz c1oinno0 swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ihc-uae_ihc-growthleaders-dynamicvaluenetworks-activity-7467686478589071360-Evwl?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAAJXMKkB-2IXzLIfgK_VLbk3iysAi_-ZJi0" target="_blank" class="w-link cr87vp0 c1rvept9 c1fa