<p>IHC&rsquo;s results were powered by landmark global transactions and platform consolidation, from the merger of 2PointZero, Multiply Group, and Ghitha Holding into a next-generation investment powerhouse, to International Resources Holding&rsquo;s acquisition of Alphamin Resources Corp (AFMJF), the launch of the AI-native reinsurance platform RIQ, and the strategic partnership with Global Citizen, alongside the divestment of our stake in Modon Holding, the largest private sector transaction in UAE market history.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/89f872cd-de3b-46c6-8ad4-63adcc104cdd 3840w" decoding="async" loading