<p>The day featured a series of high-level engagements, including a fireside chat on accelerating global growth with Robin Vince, CEO of BNY, and Paul Keary, CEO of Teneo; alongside a thought-provoking discussion with Alex Rodriguez, former MLB World Series champion and CEO of A-Rod Corp, and Chris Wearing, Chairman of Teneo International, exploring what high-performance sport reveals about capital allocation and long-term value creation.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/971e7440-a808-4b24-986c-985f5998ef17 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3