<p>The meeting brought together Syed Basar Shueb, CEO of IHC, Sofia Lasky, Board Member of IHC, and Hamad Salem Al Ameri, Group CEO of Alpha Dhabi Holding, for discussions on key trends shaping global markets and the importance of forward-looking, sustainable approaches to investment, underscoring the value of cross-sector collaboration in an increasingly interconnected global economy.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/28a279ca-023b-4b2c-93db-9ae3707ee268 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywi